1.45 (m, 2 H, PhOCH2CH2CH2(CH2)5CH3), 1.27 (m, 10 H, PhOCH2CH2CH2(CH2)5CH3), 0.89 (t, 3 H,
PhO(CH2)8CH3). 13C NMR (101 MHz, CDCl3) δ 167.0, 161.3, 160.3, 159.9, 136.7, 132.1, 128.7, 128.2, 
