1 equiv), 2-ethylhexyl bromide (0.51 g, 2.66 mmol, 1.1 equiv), K2CO3 (0.66 g, 4.76 mmol, 2 equiv) and 
DMF (15 mL) was heated to 80 °C and stirred under N2 atmosphere for 12 h. The reaction mixture was 
cooled to 23 °C and DMF was removed under reduced pressure. Then water (20 mL) was added, and the 
