compound 10 (0.60 g, 1.78 mmol, 1 equiv), 1-bromooctadecane (0.63 g, 1.96 mmol, 1.1 equiv) and K2CO3
(0.49 g, 3.56 mmol, 2 equiv) following a procedure similar to that used for the synthesis of compound 
11b. The title compound was obtained as a white solid (0.78 g, 76%). 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.15 
(br, 2 H, PhH), 6.63 (t, 1 H, PhH), 3.97 (t, 4 H, PhOCH2 CH2CH2-), 3.89 (s, 3 H, PhCOOCH3), 1.77 (m, 
4 H, PhOCH2CH2CH2-), 1.45 (m, 4 H, PhOCH2CH2CH2-), 1.26 (m, 44 H, PhOCH2CH2CH2(CH2)14CH3 
